# Portable app-image: a self-contained folder (launcher .exe + embedded
# runtime + obfuscated jar), NO installer. Needs no WiX, no .NET 3.5, no admin.
# Build with: mvn -Pinstaller -Dinstaller.os=portable verify
# Output: target/jpackage/dist/Moussa Shop/   (zip it to distribute, or feed
# it to the Inno Setup script to get a real Setup.exe).
--type
app-image
